                    "content": "Based on my research, here are the top budget-friendly recommendations for your Paris trip:\n\n## **Top Recommendations:**\n\n### **Hotel:**  \n- **Hotel Le Walt Paris**  \n  - **Rating:** 4.5  \n  - **Price:** From \u20ac60-\u20ac100 per night  \n  - **Address:** 11 Rue des \u00c9coles, 75005 Paris, France  \n  - **Budget-friendly with excellent reviews**\n\n### **Car Rental Company:**  \n- **Budget**  \n  - **Rating:** 4.3  \n  - **Price:** From \u20ac40-\u20ac60 per day (depending on car type)  \n  - **Address:** 12 Rue de la Paix, 75002 Paris, France  \n\n### **Restaurant:**  \n- **Breizh Caf\u00e9**  \n  - **Rating:** 4.0  \n  - **Price:** From \u20ac15-\u20ac25 per meal (2 meals/day)  \n  - **Address:** 109 Rue Vieille du Temple, 75003 Paris, France  \n  - **Excellent crepes, authentic Breton experience, gluten-free options**\n\n## **Budget Breakdown for 3-Day Trip:**\n\n- **Hotel (3 nights):** \u20ac180-\u20ac300  \n- **Car Rental (3 days):** \u20ac120-\u20ac180  \n- **Restaurant (6 meals):** \u20ac90-\u20ac150  \n- **Total:** \u20ac390-\u20ac630  \n- **Average daily cost:** \u20ac130-\u20ac210  \n\nThese options provide excellent value for budget-conscious travelers. Hotel Le Walt offers great location and amenities at affordable prices, Budget car rentals are very cost-effective, and Breizh Caf\u00e9 provides delicious meals at reasonable prices."
